  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The product contains all the non-3D printed parts for assembling an entirely functional Cute Flame Devil Lights. To complete the work, you also need to download the model files and 3D print the remaining parts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Creator Program: The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "To download the model files of the Cute Flame Devil Lights and obtain detailed information, please visit the Cute Flame Devil Lights on MakerWorld."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpc\">\n<!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Overview</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">The product contains all the <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">non-3D printed</strong> parts for assembling an entirely functional <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Cute Flame Devil Lights</strong>. To complete the work, you also need to download the <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">model files</strong> and <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">3D print</strong> the remaining parts.<span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></span></p>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<span data-mce-style=\"text-decoration: underline;\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><em><span data-mce-style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\" style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">Creator Program</span><span data-mce-style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\" style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">:</span></em></strong></span><strong><em> </em></strong>The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs.</div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"><br/></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K4OCdHYOOop5aGxqeiFcWXYnnXe\">\n<span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">To download the model files of the <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Cute Flame Devil Lights</strong></span><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> and obtain detailed information, please visit the <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Cute Flame Devil Lights </strong></span><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">on </span><a data-mce-href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/590211?from=search#profileId-511737\" href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/590211?from=search#profileId-511737\" rel=\"noopener\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"color: #00ae42;\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><u data-mce-fragment=\"1\">MakerWorld</u></strong></span></a><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">.</span>\n</div>\n<!-- 第四条 -->\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\"><br/></h3>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">In the Box</h3>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"height: 95px;\" style=\"height: 95px;\">\n<!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"height: 19px;\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"height: 19px; width: 483.42px;\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 483.42px;\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Item</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"height: 19px; width: 48.6285px;\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 48.6285px;\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Qty</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"height: 19px;\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"height: 19px; width: 483.42px;\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 483.42px;\">\n<div data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<div data-line=\"true\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-zone-id=\"0\">\n<p>LED Flame Tea Light Candle Set Warm Yellow (12pcs) - KC008</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"lark-record-clipboard\" data-lark-record-data='{\"rootId\":\"OKsfdVZTpoQRnExo2lIcyoskncC\",\"text\":{\"initialAttributedTexts\":{\"text\":{\"0\":\"Button\"},\"attribs\":{\"0\":\"*0+6\"}},\"apool\":{\"numToAttrib\":{\"0\":[\"author\",\"7118919285765865474\"]},\"nextNum\":1}},\"type\":\"text\",\"referenceRecordMap\":{},\"extra\":{\"mention_page_title\":{},\"external_mention_url\":{}},\"isKeepQuoteContainer\":false,\"isFromCode\":false,\"selection\":[{\"id\":64,\"type\":\"text\",\"selection\":{\"start\":0,\"end\":6},\"recordId\":\"WN9wdvxjroLLKUxZrwrcWzjZnhd\"}],\"payloadMap\":{},\"isCut\":false}' data-lark-record-format=\"docx/text\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"height: 19px; width: 48.6285px;\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 48.6285px;\">1<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"/>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"height: 19px;\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"height: 19px; width: 483.42px;\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 483.42px;\">\n<p>Remote Controlled 16-color RGBW Puck Lights (2pcs) - KC007</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-style=\"height: 19px; width: 48.6285px;\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 48.6285px;\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">1</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br/>\n</div>\n<!-- 第五条 -->\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
